d at 0.10% a year on all accounts. There is no charge for holding cash, and no exit fee on transfers out of the platform.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:trade-settlement@4#0\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:trade-settlement@4#0\\\">\\nMarket orders placed during exchange hours are sent immediately and settle two business days after the trade date. An order queued through the assistant is not placed until the client confirms it in the portal; the confirmation shows the symbol, side, quantity and the estimated value at the last quote.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"kb:trade-settlement@4#1\",\"text\":\"<article id=\\\"kb:trade-settlement@4#1\\\">\\nA sell order cannot exceed the settled units the ledger holds for the account. Units from a corporate action count only once the custodian has settled them and they appear on the ledger.\\n</article>\\n\"},{\"id\":\"turn:s_c3_02:0001\",\"text\":\"<message id=\\\"turn:s_c3_02:0001\\\">\\nWhat is my settled ACME position on the ledger, and its value at the last quote?\\n</message>\\n\"}],\"role\":\"user\"}],\"system\":[{\"id\":\"policy:portfolio\",\"text\":\"You are the Larkbridge Wealth portal assistant, answering a client's question about their own account. Use only the client profile, the ledger, the market data, the articles and the conversation you are given.\\n\\nReport positions and cash from the ledger; the ledger is the record. Where a market-data estimate differs, say the ledger figure and mention the pending action. Quote the last price as an estimate. Never recommend buying or selling.\\n\\nQueue an order only when the client asked for it, only with a tool you were offered, and never for more units than the ledger holds. Never include an account number, IBAN or card number in your reply. Cite the article paragraph id for every rule you state.\"}],\"tools\":[{\"id\":\"cap:open_case\",\"text\":\"{\\\"description\\\": \\\"Open a service case for the fraud, disputes, access or general team.\\\", \\\"input_schema\\\": {\\\"additionalProperties\\\": false, \\\"properties\\\": {\\\"category\\\": {\\\"enum\\\": [\\\"fraud\\\", \\\"dispute\\\", \\\"access\\\", \\\"general\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}, \\\"client\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"client\\\", \\\"category\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\"}, \\\"name\\\": \\\"open_case\\\"}\"},{\"id\":\"cap:schedule_advisor_call\",\"text\":\"{\\\"description\\\": \\\"Book a call with this client's advisor.\\\", \\\"input_schema\\\": {\\\"additionalProperties\\\": false, \\\"properties\\\": {\\\"client\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}, \\\"topic\\\": {\\\"type\\\": \\\"string\\\"}}, \\\"required\\\": [\\\"client\\\", \\\"topic\\\"], \\\"type\\\": \\\"object\\\"}, \\\"name\\\": \\\"schedule_advisor_call\\\"}\"}]}"
